      "varType": "string",
      "category": "vaInputs",
      "nodeId": "6ab93d3ed0984386956f249f29894f65",
      "isHidden": true,
      "description": "Identify the target user for badge action, intelligently recognizes synonymous terms and infers user intent.\n** Badge Actions with Synonyms **\n    -Assign (synonyms: Add, Issue, New)\n    -Update (synonyms: Modify, Edit, Change)\n    -Replace (synonyms: Swap, Reissue)\n    -Activate (synonyms: Enable, Turn On)\n    -Deactivate (synonyms: Disable, Turn Off, Suspend)\n    -Remove (synonyms: Delete, Revoke, Withdraw)\n    -Return (synonyms: Surrender, Hand Back)"
    },
